# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) produces CRLF files
# that Prettier rejects, so `npm run prettier:verify` fails locally while the
# identical CI step passes on Linux. Pinning eol=lf makes the local gate and
# the CI gate agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
